 OptionsTool_RadioBtns;globalParms;list;parms;n1;flag;boolean
⍝ ⍝ Presents a list (typically small) with check boxes
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 list←'White' 'Red' 'Green' 'Yellow' 'Black'
 parms←##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Select proper color'
 parms.info←'Select the most appropriate color:'
 parms.default←0 0 0 1 0
 parms.style←##.APLGUI.Enums.OptionsStyles.radio
 n1←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.Create list
 (flag boolean)←##.APLGUI.OptionsTool.ModalWait n1
 :If flag
     ⎕←' User pressed the OK button'
     ⎕←⍪boolean/list
 :Else
     ⎕←'User did NOT press the OK button'
 :EndIf
